# Google Trends Text Visualization

## Packages and helper function

This section turns related-query text into word clouds. The helper below avoids rendering failures when the underlying term list is empty.

```{r}
#| label: gttv-packages-and-helper

library(wordcloud)
library(tidytext)

safe_wordcloud <- function(words, freqs, min.freq = 3, ...) {
  valid <- !is.na(words) & nzchar(words) & !is.na(freqs) & is.finite(freqs)
  words <- words[valid]
  freqs <- freqs[valid]

  keep <- freqs >= min.freq
  words <- words[keep]
  freqs <- freqs[keep]

  if (length(words) == 0) {
    plot.new()
    text(0.5, 0.5, "No terms available for this word cloud")
    return(invisible(NULL))
  }

  wordcloud(words, freqs, min.freq = min.freq, ...)
}
```

