# Web-Scraping User Reviews from Airline Quality

## Why use review data

We rely on Skytrax Airline Quality reviews because the site contains structured user-generated feedback about service quality, aircraft, routes, ratings, and cabin class.

![](Pictures/AirlineReview.png){width=220}

::: {.callout-warning}
## Web-scraping note
Scraping is the slowest part of the workflow. In this version, the chunks below are enabled so you can run the full pipeline once and render an HTML file with actual output.
:::

## Inspecting the HTML structure

The review headline, review body, rating, seat type, aircraft, and route all appear in recurring HTML/CSS patterns.

![](Pictures/SourceCode1.png){width=220}

![](Pictures/SourceCode2.png){width=220}

## Scraping one page of reviews

```{r}
#| label: scrape-single-page

if (has_review_data) {
  message("Using saved review data from the local dataset cache. Skipping live single-page scrape.")
} else {
  library(rvest)

  link <- "https://www.airlinequality.com/airline-reviews/emirates/page/1/?sortby=post_date%3ADesc&pagesize=100"
  page_html <- safe_read_html(link)

  if (is.null(page_html)) {
    message("Could not retrieve the example Emirates page.")
  } else {
    review_tiles <- page_html %>% html_nodes(".comp_media-review-rated")
    review_articles <- page_html %>%
      html_nodes(".querylist") %>%
      html_nodes(xpath = ".//article[contains(@class, 'comp comp_media-review-rated list-item media position-content review-')]")

    Review.Title.Emirates <- review_tiles %>%
      html_node(".text_header") %>%
      html_text() %>%
      unlist()

    Review.Text.Emirates <- review_tiles %>%
      html_node(".text_content") %>%
      html_text() %>%
      unlist()

    Rating.Emirates <- review_tiles %>%
      html_nodes(".rating-10") %>%
      html_node("span:nth-child(1)") %>%
      html_text() %>%
      unlist()

    Seattype.Emirates <- review_articles %>%
      html_node(".cabin_flown+ .review-value") %>%
      html_text() %>%
      unlist()

    Aircraft.Emirates <- review_articles %>%
      html_node(".aircraft+ .review-value") %>%
      html_text() %>%
      unlist()

    Route.Emirates <- review_articles %>%
      html_node(".route+ .review-value") %>%
      html_text() %>%
      unlist()

    Emirates.Skytrax <- data.frame(
      Review.Title.Emirates = Review.Title.Emirates,
      Review.Text.Emirates = Review.Text.Emirates,
      Rating.Emirates = Rating.Emirates,
      Seat.Type.Emirates = Seattype.Emirates,
      Emirates.Aircaft = Aircraft.Emirates,
      Route.Emirates = Route.Emirates
    )
  }
}
```

